986:| `migratedTables` | the view's tables are on the activity column (`:jobs`: `jobs/runs`, `jobs/targets`; ws: `ws`, DEVDESK-144; `:sec`: `sec/inventory`, DEVDESK-145; OCI: `oci/images`, DEVDESK-146
